ajian:p001","text":"秦獻王柬，字弘度，沈敏有識量。泰始六年，封汝南王。咸甯初，徙封南陽王，拜左將軍、領右軍將軍、散騎常侍。武帝嘗幸宣武場，以三十六軍兵簿令不料校之，柬一省便擿脫謬，帝異之，于諸子中尤見寵愛。以左將軍居齊獻王故府，甚貴寵，為天下所屬目。性仁訥，無機辯之譽。太康十年，徙封于秦，邑八萬戶。于時諸王封中土者皆五萬戶，以柬與太子同產，故特加之。轉鎮西將軍、西戎校尉、假節，與楚、淮南王俱之國。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":16,"last_line":16,"raw_start":594,"raw_end":793,"raw_character_offsets":[596,597,598,599,600,601,602,603,604,605,606,607,608,609,610,616,617,618,619,622,623,624,625,626,627,628,629,630,631,632,633,634,635,636,637,638,639,640,641,642,643,644,645,646,647,648,649,650,651,652,653,654,655,656,657,658,659,660,661,662,663,664,665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,674,675,676,677,678,679,680,681,682,683,684,685,686,687,688,689,690,691,692,693,694,695,696,697,698,699,700,701,702,703,704,705,706,707,708,709,710,711,712,713,714,715,716,717,718,719,720,721,722,723,724,725,726,727,728,729,730,731,732,733,734,735,736,737,738,739,740,741,742,743,744,745,746,747,748,749,750,751,752,753,754,755,756,757,758,759,760,761,762,763,764,765,766,767,768,769,770,771,772,773,774,775,776,777,778,779,780,781,782,783,784,785,786,787,788,789,790,791,792],"revision_id":2622004},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p001:m0000","surface":"秦獻王柬","start":0,"end":4,"person_id":"x5m_ca9_16w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p001:m0051","surface":"武帝","start":51,"end":53,"person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p001:m0072","surface":"柬","start":72,"end":73,"person_id":"x5m_ca9_16w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p001:m0154","surface":"柬","start":154,"end":155,"person_id":"x5m_ca9_16w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simajian-ws2622004"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002","text":"及惠帝即位，來朝，拜驃騎將軍、開府儀同三司，加侍中、錄尚書事，進位大將軍。時楊駿伏誅，柬既痛舅氏覆滅，甚有憂危之慮，屢述武帝旨，請還籓，而汝南王亮留柬輔政。及亮與楚王瑋被誅，時人謂柬有先識。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":18,"last_line":18,"raw_start":795,"raw_end":892,"raw_character_offsets":[797,798,799,800,801,802,803,804,805,806,807,808,809,810,811,812,813,814,815,816,817,818,819,820,821,822,823,824,825,826,827,828,829,830,831,832,833,834,835,836,837,838,839,840,841,842,843,844,845,846,847,848,849,850,851,852,853,854,855,856,857,858,859,860,861,862,863,864,865,866,867,868,869,870,871,872,873,874,875,876,877,878,879,880,881,882,883,884,885,886,887,888,889,890,891],"revision_id":2622004},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002:m0001","surface":"惠帝","start":1,"end":3,"person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002:m0038","surface":"楊駿","start":38,"end":40,"person_id":"603_131_11e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002:m0043","surface":"柬","start":43,"end":44,"person_id":"x5m_ca9_16w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002:m0060","surface":"武帝","start":60,"end":62,"person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002:m0069","surface":"汝南王亮","start":69,"end":73,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian:p002:m0081","surface":"楚王瑋","start":81,"end":84,"person_id":"20b_1c2_a06","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simajian","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simajian-ws2622004"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-intro:p001","text":"武帝二十六男：楊元后生毗陵悼王軌、惠帝、秦獻王柬。審美人生城陽懷王景、楚隱王瑋、長沙厲王乂。徐才人生城陽殤王憲。匱才人生東海沖王祗。趙才人生始平哀王裕。趙美人生代哀王演。李夫人生淮南忠壯王允、吳孝王晏。嚴保林生新都懷王該。陳美人生清河康王遐。諸姬生汝陰哀王謨。程才人生成都王穎。王才人生孝懷帝。楊悼后生渤海殤王恢。餘八子不顯母氏，並早夭，又無封國及追諡，今並略之。其瑋、乂、穎自有傳。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"revie